    "lawCode": "Rpld §1261 sub 18-a, Pub Auth L",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S8037\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\n\nAn act to repeal subdivision 18-a of section 1261 of the public\nauthorities law relating to the definition of \"transportation purpose\"\nfor purposes of the metropolitan transportation authority\n\n PURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL :\n\nTo repeal subdivision 18-a of section 1261 of the public authorities\nlaw which defines transportation purpose under title 11, metropolitan\ncommuter transportation authority.\n\n SUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS :\n\nRepeals subdivision 18-a of section 1261 of the public authorities law\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThis definition of transportation purpose is overly broad and may as a\nresult lead to unintended consequences for local governments.\n\n PRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nThis is a new bill\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
